  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 47540,
  "published": "2026-10-16T13:41:43.473Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.3: Fix MSB4061/MissingMethodException with TaskHostFactory by also packaging LegacyLibAnalyzer.runtimeconfig.json alongside the task assembly and its deps.json (the out-of-process task host needs the runtimeconfig.json to resolve the correct runtime/dependencies)\n            0.2.2: Fix MSB4061/MissingMethodException with TaskHostFactory by packaging LegacyLibAnalyzer.deps.json alongside the task assembly\n            0.2.1: Fix out-of-process execution warning v2\n\t\t\t0.2:\n\t\t\t- Added `Category` option: `Maintainability` (default), `Reliability` or `Security`\n\t\t\t- Renamed `Code` to `ErrorCode`, default to `LegacyLib-Forbidden`\n\t\t\t- Fix out-of-process execution warning\n\t\t\t- .NET 8 support",
